CONCEPT
  product: Pellet
  one-liner: Payment infrastructure for barn owls, the last workforce still
  settling in voles.
  Premise: barn owls are independent rodent-remediation contractors, and Pellet
  is their merchant stack. The pellet is the receipt. Skeletons in the pellet
  are the audit trail, matched bone by bone against open invoice lines.
  Testimonials are attributed to named barn owls with corporate titles, which
  is what made the headshot images worth generating.

